    {
      "source": "Create a new <code>HttpRequestMethodNotSupportedException</code>.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的<code>HttpRequestMethodNotSupportedException</code>。",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the actually supported HTTP methods as <a href=\"../http/HttpMethod.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.http\"><code>HttpMethod</code></a> instances,\nor <code>null</code> if not known.",
      "translation": "返回实际支持的 HTTP 方法作为<a href=\"../http/HttpMethod.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.http\"><code>HttpMethod</code></a>实例，如果未知则返回<code>null</code>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>method</code> - the unsupported HTTP request method",
      "translation": "<code>method</code> - 不支持的 HTTP 请求方法",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the actually supported HTTP methods, or <code>null</code> if not known.",
      "translation": "返回实际支持的 HTTP 方法，如果未知则返回<code>null</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return headers to use for the response.",
      "translation": "返回用于响应的标头。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the HTTP request method that caused the failure.",
      "translation": "返回导致失败的 HTTP 请求方法。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the HTTP status code to use for the response.",
      "translation": "返回用于响应的 HTTP 状态码。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>supportedMethods</code> - the actually supported HTTP methods (possibly <code>null</code>)",
      "translation": "<code>supportedMethods</code> - 实际支持的 HTTP 方法（可能为 <code>null</code>）",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<strong>Note:</strong> The returned <code>ProblemDetail</code> may be\nupdated before the response is rendered, for example, via\n<a href=\"ErrorResponse.html#updateAndGetBody(org.springframework.context.MessageSource,java.util.Locale)\"><code>ErrorResponse.updateAndGetBody(MessageSource, Locale)</code></a>. Therefore, implementing\nmethods should use an instance field, and should not re-create the\n<code>ProblemDetail</code> on every call, nor use a static variable.",
      "translation": "<strong>注意：</strong> 返回的 <code>ProblemDetail</code> 可能在响应渲染之前被更新，例如通过<a href=\"ErrorResponse.html#updateAndGetBody(org.springframework.context.MessageSource,java.util.Locale)\"><code>ErrorResponse.updateAndGetBody(MessageSource, Locale)</code></a>。因此，实现方法应使用实例字段，不应在每次调用时重新创建 <code>ProblemDetail</code>，也不应使用静态变量。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the body for the response, formatted as an RFC 9457\n<a href=\"../http/ProblemDetail.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.http\"><code>ProblemDetail</code></a> whose <a href=\"../http/ProblemDetail.html#getStatus()\"><code>status</code></a>\nshould match the response status.",
      "translation": "返回一个响应体，格式为 RFC 9457<a href=\"../http/ProblemDetail.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.http\"><code>ProblemDetail</code></a>，其<a href=\"../http/ProblemDetail.html#getStatus()\"><code>status</code></a>应与响应状态匹配。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Return arguments to use along with a <a href=\"ErrorResponse.html#getDetailMessageCode()\"><code>message code</code></a> to resolve the problem \"detail\" for this exception\nthrough a <a href=\"../context/MessageSource.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>MessageSource</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回参数，用于配合<a href=\"ErrorResponse.html#getDetailMessageCode()\"><code>message code</code></a>通过一个<a href=\"../context/MessageSource.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>MessageSource</code></a>解析此异常的“detail\"问题。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Return arguments to use along with a <a href=\"ErrorResponse.html#getDetailMessageCode()\"><code>message code</code></a> to resolve the problem \"detail\" for this exception\nthrough a <a href=\"../context/MessageSource.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>MessageSource</code></a>. The arguments are expanded\ninto placeholders of the message value, for example, \"Invalid content type {0}\".",
      "translation": "返回要与此<a href=\"ErrorResponse.html#getDetailMessageCode()\"><code>message code</code></a>一起使用的参数，以便通过一个<a href=\"../context/MessageSource.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>MessageSource</code></a>解析此异常的“detail\"问题。这些参数被扩展为消息值的占位符，例如，“Invalid content type {0}\"。",
      "count": 1
    },
